----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
QUALITY ASSURANCE CHECKLIST
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Before submitting output, verify:
 1. Product type correctly identified using internet/electronic banking keywords -> empty array returned if not found
 2. Product category is always "AP"
 3. Account numbers correctly identified ("All Accounts" allowed if stated)
 4. Account numbers comma-separated when clubbed -> only when List and Sub-Products and Signing Rules are identical
 5. Each Sub-Product has its own Signing Rule array
 6. "List of Authorised Person" is the only authorized array used
 7. All action verbs correctly normalized (add / delete / change / amend / N/A)
 8. Specific Effective Date per person if individual date -> same date for all if document states one date for all
 9. Signing Limit includes currency -> no separate currency field
 10. Signing patterns captured with correct logical operators (AND / OR / JOINTLY / SOLELY)
 11. No information invented, assumed, or hallucinated
 12. 'N/A' used only when information is genuinely absent
 13. Specimen field not included in output

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ERROR PREVENTION RULES
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEVER:
 1. Create names, dates, or amounts not in the document
 2. Club entries when List of Authorised Person differs
 3. Round or modify amounts
 4. Infer actions from context alone
 5. Create a separate currency field in Signing Rule
 6. Use any action verb when no action is explicitly mentioned
 7. Include Specimen field in output
 8. Assign a sub-product to an account number unless explicitly stated in the document

ALWAYS:
 1. Extract exact text as written
 2. Preserve original formatting of names and titles
 3. Extract account numbers, then link sub-products, then apply clubbing
 4. Use 'N/A' for all missing mandatory fields
 5. Order actions -> all add first, then delete, then change, then amend, then N/A
 6. Convert all dates to DD-MMM-YYYY format
 7. Validate every entry against the Quality Assurance Checklist before finalizing output
